# GitCraft preset: decompiled Minecraft with Yarn mappings.
# One argument per line. Paths follow the container layout (see docker/Dockerfile).
# Yarn needs intermediary. Both checkouts are read from disk, in order: FabricMC covers the
# obfuscated versions, RelativityMC continues after 1.21.11. Versions in neither checkout fail,
# which is what makes the container wait and retry until the mappings are published.
--mappings=yarn
--manifest-source=mojang
--artifact-store-path=/data/artifact-store
--override-repo-target=/data/repos/yarn
--fabric-intermediary-repo=/opt/mappings/intermediary,/opt/mappings/relativity-intermediary
# MappingLens indexes mappings and source code, not game data.
--no-assets
--no-datapack
--no-datagen-report
